 Hmm.\n\nLet me look for the specific changed code \"interval shown on each button is now computed directly by the backend scheduler.\" A bug could be that the button intervals show for the *previous* card or don't update when the card changes. Let's test by answering and seeing the next card's buttons. Or navigating without answering.\n\nBut also, this is a \"new study screen\" possibly. Note the Settings has \"New study screen\" with \"Answer buttons\". Maybe the app uses the new study screen. The old study screen is what we're seeing? Let's check the \"New study screen\" settings.\n\nLet me first note the current state and take a screenshot to see the answer buttons with times. Then maybe test a card with different history.\n\nLet me screenshot."}
